    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Posted blng__Invoice__c records with no blng__LegalEntity__c set.
Why it matters: Invoices without a legal entity can&apos;t be reliably routed to the right tax jurisdiction, currency, or remit-to address. Compliance risk on cross-border billing.
Suppress a finding: during a planned legal-entity backfill exercise.
Disable the detector: only if your org operates as a single legal entity and the field is intentionally blank. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
